[1.0.0] - INITIAL RELEASE

ADDED - CORE FEATURES

Player Features
- God Mode (Life + Joker + Traps)
- Speed Hack (F2)
- No Gravity (F3)
- Noclip (F4)
- Respawn button
- Custom Controls (Walk, Run, Jump, Crouch, Air speeds)
- Teleportation system (T key)

Time Features
- Timer Overlay (display on screen)
- Custom timer color (White, Red, Green)
- Custom timer size (12 to 48)
- TimeScale (0x to 5x)

Joker AI Features
- Deaf Mode (Joker can't hear)
- Freeze Joker (he can't move)
- Real-time difficulty mod selection (Ghost, Easy, Medium, Hard, Extreme)

Utility Features
- Tutorials system (replay game tutorials)
- Code Locks scanner (display all codes)
- Custom Trap Size (0.1x to 5x)
- Custom Interaction Distance (up to 50 meters)
- Item Presets (Preset A, B, C, Random)
- Drone Mode (free aerial view)

ESP Features
- Joker ESP (name + distance)
- Wallhack (see through walls)
- Distance display

Visual Features
- Graphics Quality (Ultra, High, Medium, Low, Very Low)
- Unlimited FPS
- FPS Counter (7 colors)
- Custom FOV (30 to 120)
- Custom Brightness (0 to 2)

Audio Features
- Custom Music system (.ogg / .wav support)
- Volume, Pitch, Speed controls
- Playlist system (order + shuffle)
- Joker Phrases player

Item Features
- Item Scanner (34 items available)
- Item Spawn
- Clear Inventory

Options
- Keybinds toggle (F2-F4)
- Tips system (76 phrases)
- Keyboard Overlay (Small, Normal, Large)
- Debug Info
- Mod Information panel

---

ADDED - ANOMALY SYSTEM

10 unique anomalies unlocked from the start:

1. BLACKOUT
   - Dark fog, but Joker vision is very low

2. NOTHING TO HIDE
   - Joker chases you permanently, but all doors are open

3. DEATH TRAP
   - 110 traps total in 6 minutes

4. STONE COLD
   - 2 stones, throw them at precise targets to reset the timer

5. DEAF JOKER IN MIRRORLAND
   - Joker hears nothing, but map and controls are mirrored

6. DOUBLE TROUBLE
   - The Joker brought his twin brother

7. SQUAT GAME
   - Crouching makes the Joker faster, but you can jump

8. LSD
   - Interaction distance 4m + random visual effects

9. ONE DIFFICULTY
   - Random difficulty changes + only one life

10. FREEZE TAG
    - You are faster, but if the Joker spots you, you are frozen for 3 seconds

---

ADDED - LOCALIZATION

Full support for 6 languages:

- French (fr)
- English (en)
- Spanish (es)
- German (de)
- Italian (it)
- Russian (ru)

Automatic system language detection.
Language saved in PlayerPrefs.

---

ADDED - UI / UX

- F1 Menu with 9 tabs (Player, Time, Joker, Utils, ESP, Visuals, Audio, Items, Options)
- Purple eye button for Anomaly Menu
- Welcome Message (Read-Me with Steam username)
- Tips system (76 phrases)
- Quick buttons (Menu, Speed, Gravity, Noclip)
- Custom menu background support (menu_bg.png/jpg)
- Custom mod logo support (logo.png/jpg)
- Custom game logo replacement (game_logo.png)

---

ADDED - CUSTOM MUSIC

- Support for .ogg and .wav files
- Folder: Mods/Music/
- Playlist system (plays in order, loops at the end)
- Shuffle mode (random track, no repeat)
- Volume control
- Pitch control (0.5x to 2x)
- Speed control (0.5x to 2x)
- Reset Pitch/Speed button
- Reset Playlist button
- M key to mute/unmute in-game

---


Bugs fixed on mod:

1. Timer not stopping 
2. "Disable AI" button not working (I removed this)
3. "Find Joker Position" button removed
4. Removed the size feature for the player and joker, because the game crashed and extremely buggy with them features (the modification of the size of the traps is still there) 
5. Preset system (bugged)
6. FOV conflict with binoculars
7. Fog issue (replaced by Brightness)
8. Tips not displaying correctly
9. DEATH TRAP timer end
10. STONE COLD timer end
11. Anomalies could accumulate, now it's fixed
12. Many bugs for Anomaly reset, now it's fixed

---

IMPROVED - MOD BEHAVIOR

- Custom music playlist now correctly rotates through all tracks
- BLACKOUT anomaly fog is disabled when using binoculars
- Custom Controls no longer conflict with Speed Hack
